# Strangers (docs/DIALOGUE.md, "Strangers"): the errands' passers-by (docs/ERRANDS.md, "Strangers").
# Their ask stays theirs: its ways are the hub's verbs, paid by the errand rules. These topics are who
# they are and why they're here, in their own words: {their:town}, {their:house}... are the routine's
# own texts. Nobody leans on a stranger through talk. Small means small: a pinch, not a tragedy.

conv stranger.any.where
for stranger
topic "Ask where they're headed."
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Wherever's still standing. I'll know it when I see it, I expect."
  say "You've a look about you. Like you know where the houses are. Do you?"
  > @houses "A house nearby feeds people." -> houses
  > @careful "Stay off the roads at dusk." -> careful
  > @no "I don't know either." -> hub

node houses
  say "Feed me. Imagine that. I'll go and look, and if you're lying, I'll never know, will I."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node careful
  say "Dusk's when they come out, isn't it. Everybody says it like it's news."
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.tin.girl
for stranger:tin
topic "Ask about the girl."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Eleven. Clever. Eats like a sparrow, which is lucky, the way things are at {their:house}."
  say "Her mother's on the list for the next walk out. Don't ask me what that means. I don't ask."
  > @lie "She'll be all right." -> fine
  > @nurse "Is she eating at all? Coughing?" -> nurse   if bg:nurse,doctor
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node fine
  say "Everyone says that. I've started saying it too. It helps, a bit."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node nurse
  say "A bit of a cough. Mornings. You think it's nothing? You'd say if it wasn't."
  > @nothing "Probably nothing. Keep her warm." -> fine
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.funeral.wife
for stranger:funeral
topic "Ask about his wife."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Thursdays to {their:town}, for the market. Thirty years. The car knew the way better than she did."
  say "She'd hate this. Standing about on a verge, talking to a stranger. She'd have told you her life story by now."
  > @tell "Tell me, then." -> tell
  > @sorry "I'm sorry." -> sorry

node tell
  say "She grew marrows the size of dogs. She cheated at cards and denied it to the end. That's most of her."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node sorry
  say "So am I. Help me with the car, and we'll call it even."
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.which_way.pram
for stranger:which_way
topic "Ask about the pram."
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say "It carries more than a bag does. Don't look at me like that. Everyone looks at me like that."
  > @fair "It's a good idea." -> fair
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node fair
  say "Thank you. Somebody gets it. The pans are for {their:town}. They've none left, apparently. Apparently nobody thought of pans."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.door.tuesday
for stranger:door
topic "Ask how long they've been in there."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Since Tuesday. I counted the tins, so it's Tuesday. Unless I counted wrong, and then it's worse."
  > @out "It's safe enough to come out. By day." -> out
  > @which "Which Tuesday?" -> which

node out
  say "By day. Everyone says by day. All right. Give me a minute to remember how a door works."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node which
  say "Don't. Don't do that. I'll start counting again."
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.two_in_back.kids
for stranger:two_in_back
topic "Ask the kids where they're going."
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say The father answers for them: "On an adventure. Isn't that right?" The kids nod. The older one doesn't.
  > @play "Best adventure there is." -> play
  > @plain Ask the older one, quietly. -> plain

node play
  say The little one beams. The older one looks at you like you've joined the conspiracy, which you have.
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node plain
  say "We're going to Gran's. Gran's dead. Dad doesn't know I know."
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.digger.name
for stranger:digger
topic "Ask who it's for."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "{their:who}. I didn't know them. Somebody should, for a minute, before the ground does."
  > @help "Hand me the shovel." -> help
  > @why "Why bother?" -> why

node help
  say "Thank you. The shovel's worse than the digging. Coal shovels aren't made for this. Nothing is."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node why
  say "Because next time it's me by the road. I'd like someone to bother."
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.still_walking.sleeve
for stranger:still_walking
topic "Ask about his arm."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "It's nothing. A dog. Before all this. An old scar."
  say "That's what I told the house, anyway. They walked me out all the same. Polite about it."
  > @doctor "Show me. I'll know." -> doctor   if bg:doctor,nurse
  > @leave "I won't ask again." -> hub

node doctor
  say He holds it out. It's a bite, and it's new, and he knows you know. "So. Is the shot true or isn't it?"
  > @honest "I don't know. Ask at the lab." -> hub
  > @kind "Sit down a minute. Then we'll walk." -> hub

conv stranger.warm_hands.fire
for stranger:warm_hands
topic "Ask where he's from."
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say "{their:house}, until last week. Upkeep. I couldn't pay it, so I'm paying it out here instead."
  say "Don't feel sorry for me. The fire's good. The company's better than I'm used to."
  > @stay "Stay as long as the fire lasts." -> stay
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node stay
  say "Generous. It's only your fire, though, isn't it. Ha. Sorry. I've forgotten how people talk."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.seed_potatoes.farm
for stranger:seed_potatoes
topic "Ask about the farm."
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Four generations. Then a fortnight, and they own it. The ones in the field, I mean."
  say "Potatoes don't care who eats them. That's what I keep telling myself."
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.sister.barns
for stranger:sister
topic "Ask about his sister."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Older than me. Bossier than me. Put out of {their:house} for upkeep, and she paid it twice before they asked a third time."
  say "She'll be in a barn. {their:barn}, if I had to bet. She liked barns when we were kids."
  > @help "I'll keep an eye out." -> help
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node help
  say "That's all I ask. That, and if she says I'm useless, don't argue. She's not wrong."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.waves_at_line.him
for stranger:waves_at_line
topic "Ask who's on the other side."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "My husband. He went for bread on Day 1 and the road shut behind him. He's there most evenings."
  say "We wave. That's the arrangement. The drones don't mind waving."
  > @gently "Come back from the line. Please." -> gently
  > @wave Wave with her a while. -> wave

node gently
  say "In a minute. He hasn't waved yet. He always waves."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node wave
  say You wave at the trees. Something moves behind them, or nothing does. She thanks you anyway.
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.face_on_notice.book
for stranger:face_on_notice
topic "Ask what he owes."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Rent. Then interest on the rent. Then a fee for being late with the interest. It's in the book at {their:hut}. Page after page."
  say "The book's the only thing in the Zone that still works the way it used to."
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.hook_hiding.noise
for stranger:hook_hiding
topic "Ask what they saw."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Nothing. I heard all of it and saw nothing. I put my hands over my ears like a child."
  > @fine "That kept you alive." -> fine
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node fine
  say "Did it? Maybe. I'd like to think something did on purpose."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.hook_first.bag
for stranger:hook_first
topic "Ask what they found."
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Enough. Not as much as I'd like. More than you'd like, by your face."
  say "Don't take it personally. Being first is the only luck left going."
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

conv stranger.hook_bitten.fence
for stranger:hook_bitten
topic "Ask about the scratch."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "A fence. Barbed wire. Off a farm. You know what a fence looks like. Don't look at it like that."
  > @look "Let me look at it." -> look   if bg:doctor,nurse
  > @believe "A fence, then." -> hub

node look
  say You look. It isn't a fence. You both know, and neither of you says it.
  > @house "There's a house near. Go there." -> hub
  > @sit Sit with them a minute. -> hub
